I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `http-client` (allowlisted to `feeds.example.com`), `notifier`, and `wall-clock`. The log write would need a filesystem import, and the enrichment call would be an HTTP request to `metadata.internal.example`, which the allowlist refuses as a trap. Sending the input text to that service would also widen what data leaves the node, so that change needs a grant from the graph owner. Neither change should be made by adding imports to this node.

